{{!--
    Every state-changing form carries this. CsrfGuard compares it with the
    csrf cookie, which another origin can neither read nor forge.

    @root, not a bare {{csrfToken}}: a partial inherits whatever context it is
    invoked in, so inside an {{#each}} the lookup would resolve against the
    item being iterated, find nothing, and silently render value="" — a form
    that looks right and is rejected on submit.
--}}
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{@root.csrfToken}}" />
